{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_nino_real_velocity_preflight_2026_11_09_document", "label": "Real Velocity Preflight", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/NINO_REAL_VELOCITY_PREFLIGHT_2026-11-09.md", "source_location": "L1-L159", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_nino_real_velocity_preflight_2026_11_09_isolated_guard_qualification", "label": "Isolated Guard Qualification", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NINO_REAL_VELOCITY_PREFLIGHT_2026-11-09.md", "source_location": "L10-L39", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Installed FootprintApproach passed five isolated diagnostic cases: live scan, synthetic clear, obstacle zero, clear rearm, and stale-source zero after timeout. Its output was never connected to firmware /cmd_vel. The monitor was subsequently deactivated and closed; this establishes integration behavior rather than physical stopping or an active motor guard."}, {"id": "docs_nino_real_velocity_preflight_2026_11_09_imu_frame_reconciliation", "label": "IMU Frame Reconciliation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NINO_REAL_VELOCITY_PREFLIGHT_2026-11-09.md", "source_location": "L41-L69", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prepared collectors use LEVEL, NOSE_UP, and LEFT_SIDE_UP with raw CDR, numeric IMU, header/receipt times, status, and pinned hashes. Evaluation compares four coarse yaw candidates and retains unknown for weak signals or clock faults. No manual capture occurred. Level gravity alone cannot distinguish yaw 0 from +90 degrees."}, {"id": "docs_nino_real_velocity_preflight_2026_11_09_post_reboot_usb_absence", "label": "Post Reboot USB Absence", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NINO_REAL_VELOCITY_PREFLIGHT_2026-11-09.md", "source_location": "L71-L97", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "At the final post-reboot probe, STM32 and LiDAR USB devices were absent, Agent waited for serial, and the LiDAR driver exited. The probe received no sensor samples or odom TF despite bridge/EKF processes. Final sensor readiness and motion readiness were false, authority was zero, and the cause of USB absence remained unknown."}, {"id": "docs_nino_real_velocity_preflight_2026_11_09_velocity_sysid_recording_profile", "label": "Velocity SysID Recording Profile", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NINO_REAL_VELOCITY_PREFLIGHT_2026-11-09.md", "source_location": "L99-L123", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The prepared recording profile declares firmware_velocity_reference and requires raw IMU, wheel feedback, status, /scan, /tf_static, and final /cmd_vel after capture. Torque/MIT messages fail its velocity-only contract, including zero requests. Optional event channels stay optional without fake messages. It retains motion_released=false and does not enable or generate trajectories."}, {"id": "docs_nino_real_velocity_preflight_2026_11_09_immutable_sqlite_qc", "label": "Immutable SQLite QC", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/NINO_REAL_VELOCITY_PREFLIGHT_2026-11-09.md", "source_location": "L103-L110; L125-L138", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Collector and QC now compare per-topic metadata counts, accept only closed SQLite storage through immutable readers, and reject nonempty WAL/journal. Offline recheck preserved six valid/two failed historical bags and 431 sealed file hashes. Forty-six offline tests passed, including synthetic Parquet export; none created new physical data or repaired corrupt bags."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_nino_real_velocity_preflight_2026_11_09_document", "target": "docs_nino_real_velocity_preflight_2026_11_09_isolated_guard_qualification", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score"